  "body": [
    "THE CAFÉ & SHOWROOM",
    "Part coffee bar, part showroom, part gathering place. Sit with a cup, get hands-on with the machines, and stay for a class — no purchase, no pressure.",
    "Find your nearest café→",
    "See what's inside",
    "WHY COME IN",
    "Taste before you commit Flight through the coffee, tea and cold-press range at the bar. Find the cup you'll want at home.",
    "Flight through the coffee, tea and cold-press range at the bar. Find the cup you'll want at home.",
    "Meet the machines Pull a shot on the Atelier line yourself. Feel the difference before it lands on your counter.",
    "Pull a shot on the Atelier line yourself. Feel the difference before it lands on your counter.",
    "Learn from the team Brewing classes, latte-art labs and cuppings led by people who do it every day.",
    "Brewing classes, latte-art labs and cuppings led by people who do it every day.",
    "Somewhere to linger A warm room to meet, work, or read the morning away. Come for the coffee, stay for the quiet.",
    "A warm room to meet, work, or read the morning away. Come for the coffee, stay for the quiet.",
    "THE EXPERIENCE",
    "01 · THE TASTE BAR",
    "Sit at the bar and work through the range — espresso and slow-pour coffee, loose-leaf tea, and cold-pressed juice. Our team talks you through each one and builds a tasting flight around what you like. It's the fastest way to find your everyday cup.",
    "Browse the coffee range→",
    "02 · THE SHOWROOM",
    "The full Atelier range is set up and running. Pull your own shot, watch the machine learn a profile, and ask the questions a spec sheet can't answer. When you're ready, we'll help you pick the one that fits your kitchen — or arrange a home delivery.",
    "Explore the machines→",
    "03 · THE TABLE",
    "Most evenings the long table hosts something — a brewing class, a latte-art lab, a cupping, or just a slow community morning. Classes are small and hands-on, and most are free with a drink. Check what's on below and save a seat.",
    "See what's on→",
    "WHAT'S ON",
    "Free with a drink unless noted",
    "TUESDAY Origins cupping Taste three single-origin lots side by side and learn to name what you taste. 6:30–7:30PM Free",
    "TUESDAY",
    "Taste three single-origin lots side by side and learn to name what you taste.",
    "WEDNESDAY Latte-art lab Hands-on milk steaming and pour practice on the Atelier line. Beginners welcome. 6:00–7:30PM $15",
    "WEDNESDAY",
    "Hands-on milk steaming and pour practice on the Atelier line. Beginners welcome.",
    "THURSDAY Home brewing 101 Dial in grind, dose and time for a filter cup you can repeat at home. 6:30–8:00PM Free",
    "THURSDAY",
    "Dial in grind, dose and time for a filter cup you can repeat at home.",
    "SATURDAY Slow morning cupping A relaxed community tasting over pastries. Drop in, no booking needed. 9:00–11:00AM Free",
    "SATURDAY",
    "A relaxed community tasting over pastries. Drop in, no booking needed.",
    "FIND US",
    "From flagship showrooms to the café on the corner, we're probably closer than you think. Every café pours the full range — showrooms and workshop tables vary by location.",
    "1,200+ CAFÉS NATIONWIDE",
